classDiagram
    %% PawPal+ class design. Keep this file updated so it matches the final implementation.

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +int available_minutes
        +dict preferences
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet: Pet) None
        +update_preferences(preferences: dict) None
        +update_available_time(minutes: int) None
    }

    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +dict preferences
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task: Task) None
        +remove_task(task: Task) None
        +update_info(name, species, preferences) None
    }

    class Task {
        +str title
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +Optional~time~ preferred_time
        +date due_date
        +str recurrence
        +bool completed
        +update_details(...) None
        +mark_complete() None
        +is_due(on_date: date) bool
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +Owner owner
        +time day_start
        +get_due_tasks(on_date: date) list~Task~
        +sort_tasks(tasks: list~Task~) list~Task~
        +detect_conflicts(schedule: list) list
        +generate_schedule(on_date: date) list
        +explain_schedule() str
    }

    Owner "1" o-- "0..*" Pet : owns
    Pet "1" *-- "0..*" Task : has
    Scheduler --> Owner : schedules for
    Scheduler ..> Task : sorts / schedules
